     "probs": {
      "measured": 0.963,
      "literature": 0.037
     },
     "said": [
      "## 4) Horizontal nest distance Based on the horizontal distance of the nest relative to the food source, we defined four categories: 0) within food source, 1) starting within food source but with a horizontal extension, 2) a short distance out from the food source and 3) a great distance out from the food source."
     ],
     "value": "measured"
